  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating sustainable jobs for high potential youth in the MENA region, through offering online educational programs and job placement at companies.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch start-up Talent Acceleration Platform (TAP) B.V. is a software house that offers programs in software development, business development and digital marketing to train high potentials from Palestine, as well as from Jordan and Lebanon, and connect them with global startups for mutual impact. With the 600k DGGF loan and 150k fresh equity from new investors, TAP aims to scale their education programs and job placement rates.</narrative>
  </description>
